#. module: account_move_partner_bank
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:account_move_partner_bank.res_partner_view_form
msgid ""
"Unlike the other accounting settings, the recipient bank can be set on a "
"contact, so that it is invoiced with a bank account of its own (e.g. a "
"branch that collects on a different account than its head office)."
msgstr "他の会計設定と異なり、受取銀行口座は連絡先に設定できます。これにより、その連絡先の請求書には独自の銀行口座が使用されます（例: 本社とは異なる口座で回収する支店）。"

